OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a cold start to the day
OL,6,Fthis morning will be dry and sunny.
OL,7,FThen this afternoon will remain dry
OL,8,Fwith plenty of sunshine. Cold.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry and
OL,11,Fclear. Then the rest of the night will
OL,12,Fbe dry with lengthy clear periods and
OL,13,Fa widespread sharp frost.
OL,14,
OL,15,CSaturday:FAfter a frosty start all
OL,16,Fparts will have a dry, cold and sunny
OL,17,Fday. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
